  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNCDF Financing Inclusive Digital Economy in Zambia - UNCDF Zambian Digital Bridge Facility Scoping</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNCDF Zambia digital finansiering och tj&#xe4;nster</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att tillg&#xe4;ngligg&#xf6;ra finansiering f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5;f&#xf6;retag som anv&#xe4;nder digitala betalningsmetoder. Denna f&#xf6;rberedande insats syftar till att utveckla en facilitet f&#xf6;r l&#xe5;n, fr&#xe5;n zambiska banker och mikrofinansf&#xf6;retag, till mikro-, sm&#xe5;- och medelstora f&#xf6;retag som anv&#xe4;nder digitala betalningsm&#xf6;jligheter och som erbjuder tj&#xe4;nster som f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar livsvillkoren f&#xf6;r fattiga m&#xe4;nniskor till rimliga kostnader. Insatsen ska ge underlag inf&#xf6;r en beredning med syfte att utreda f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r eventuellt beslut om en garanti fr&#xe5;n Sida. Dessutom ska kunskapsst&#xf6;d ges till f&#xf6;retagen inf&#xf6;r l&#xe5;neans&#xf6;kningsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution involves support for increased access to finance for service providers using digital payments. This preparatory contribution aims at developing a loan guarantee facility with Zambian banks and financial institutions, for loans to companies that offer services that can improve poor people&apos;s livelihoods, through digital payment methods and at affordable costs. The contribution shall provide a basis for Sida&apos;s assessment of the conditions for a potential guarantee from Sida. The contribution also involves support for the application process to potential borrowers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main results expected during this extension phase are the following:
- The proposal for cooperation between UNCDF and Sweden will be finalized and approved.
- The technical (re-guarantee agreement) and programmatic (technical assistance agreement) cooperation will be formalized.
- Final versions of the guarantee term sheet and portfolio guarantee agreement to be signed between UNCDF / Sweden and the PFIs are in place.
- PFIs participating in the LG and TA program are extensively assessed, selected, agreements signed, and formal onboarding process is completed.
- All the tools to be used in implementing and managing the LG and TA facility are in place.
- The additional staff needed for implementation of the LG and TA program are in place.</narrative>
  </description>
